/**
 * @aurora/ui — Theme catalog index (AD-17, 05 §5.8).
 *
 * SSoT: the 10 Aurora expressive themes + 32 tweakcn imports + 3 presets
 * live as JSON in this directory (AD-15). Adding a theme = adding a JSON
 * file + one line here — no code change (05 §5.8).
 *
 * The 32 `tweakcn-*` themes are generated by
 * `scripts/import-tweakcn-themes.mjs` from the OFFICIAL tweakcn palettes
 * (tweakcn.com/r/themes/<name>.json). Only the accent tokens are imported:
 * `neutral.ts` stays frozen (05 §2.1.2 — a theme never redefines the canvas
 * or the semantic states).
 */

